WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:07.687
CompTIA Network Plus, domain 1, Networking concepts, which is 23 percent of the exam.

00:00:07.687 --> 00:00:10.296
This lesson covers objective 1 point 3.

00:00:10.296 --> 00:00:13.641
Summarize cloud concepts and connectivity options.

00:00:13.641 --> 00:00:18.190
Today: how does a virtual private cloud actually reach the internet?

00:00:20.530 --> 00:00:26.520
A virtual private cloud, or V P C, is your own isolated network inside the provider's cloud.

00:00:26.870 --> 00:00:30.430
By default, the instances inside have no path to the internet.

00:00:30.770 --> 00:00:33.670
The component that fixes that is the internet gateway.

00:00:33.670 --> 00:00:39.310
It attaches to the V P C and connects it to the internet, and the subnet needs a route that points to it.

00:00:39.630 --> 00:00:44.930
Traffic now flows both ways between the V P C and the internet, through the internet gateway.

00:00:47.270 --> 00:00:54.349
When the question asks which cloud component lets a V P C exchange traffic with the internet, the answer is the internet gateway.

00:00:54.349 --> 00:00:56.160
That's objective one point three.
